\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 1a. (ff. 1r-3r) Prolegomena zu Platon (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1 \u963 \'f3\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ? \plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 [\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ? \plain \f1\fs24 durch Unterpunktion getilgt\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u955 \'eb\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\fs24 ); \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 inc\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8158 ?\u927 \'cf\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2 \u963 \'f3\u8051 ?\u946 \'e2\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed \u928 \'d0\u955 \'eb\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 des. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ? \u948 \'e4\u8050 ? \u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed \u8000 ?\u961 \'f1\u952 \'e8\u8182 ?\u962 \'f2 \u955 \'eb\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9.\plain \f1\fs24 Vgl. L. G. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Westerink - B. Laourdas\plain \f1\fs24 , Scholia by Arethas in Vindob. phil. Gr. 314, in: Hellenika 17 (1962), S. 105. Der Text setzt sich zusammen aus \plain \f1\ul\fs24 erstens\plain \f1\fs24 : (f. 1r, 1.-22. Z. v. o.) Ausz\u252 \'fcge aus <\plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Olympiodorus Alexandrinus\plain \f1\fs24 >, Kommentar zu Platon, Gorgias: (f. 1r, 1.-11. Z. v. o.) \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8158 ?\u927 \'cf\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2 - \u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u957 \'ed \u959 \'ef\u8016 ?\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u8054 ? \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u8166 ?\u964 \'f4\u8049 ? \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5, \plain \f1\fs24 ed. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 L. G. Westerink\plain \f1\fs24 , Olympiodori in Platonis Gorgiam Commentaria, Leipzig 1970, S. 214, 25-215, 11. - (f. 1r, 12.-22. Z. v. o.) \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8158 ?\u927 \'cf\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9 \u8001 ? \u916 \'c4\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u952 \'e8\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2 \u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u966 \'f6\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1 \u8190 ?\u919 \'c7\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8057 ?\u948 \'e4\u969 \'f9\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed - \u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u959 \'ef\u8023 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u8001 ? \u8165 ?\u8053 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u961 \'f1 \u7936 ?\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u962 \'f2 \u928 \'d0\u955 \'eb\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\fs24 , ed. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Westerink\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 215, 19-27. }

