333v-340r) 5. - (ff. 340r-346v) 6. - (ff. 346v-356v) 7. - (ff. 356v-362v) 8. - (ff. 363r-375r) 9; Kommentar zu Ier. 9, 24-27, ed. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Canet\plain \f1\fs24 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Lit\plain \f1\fs24 ), S. 171-190 u. a. nach dieser Hs. - (ff. 375r-397v) 10. - (f. 397v) am Ende: \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u948 \'e4\u969 \'f9\u954 \'ea\u8060 ?\u962 \'f2 \u949 \'e5\u8016 ?\u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8179 ?\u-7368 ? \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u8179 ?. }

