\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 (ff. 295r-343v) \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Andronicus Comnenus <Ducas Palaeologus>\plain \f1\fs24 , Dialogus contra Iudaeos (Ms. ohne Titel), ed. lat. PG 133, 797-924; zum Autor und zum Text vgl. Cod. Vindob. theol. gr. 118 (\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 H. Hunger - O. Kresten\plain \f1\fs24 , Katalog der griechischen Handschriften der \u214 \'d6sterreichischen Nationalbibliothek. Teil 3/2, Codices Theologici 101-200, Wien 1984, S. 53-54); \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 inc\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\u8053 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u8054 ? \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u948 \'e4\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9 \u948 \'e4\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u963 \'f3\u8051 ?\u946 \'e2\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 des. \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ? \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ? \u948 \'e4\u8059 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u8183 ? \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\plain \f6\lang1033\fs24 \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 ? \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u8183 ?\plain \f6\lang1033\fs24 \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 ? \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\u8049 ?\u947 \'e3\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u903 ? \u959 \'ef\u8016 ?\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u8166 \u8183 ?\u957 \'ed \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\plain \f6\lang1033\fs24 \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 ? \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u8179 ? \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u7936 ?\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u8179 ? \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\plain \f6\lang1033\fs24 `\plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u837 ? \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u945 \'e1\u7984 ?\u8061 ?\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed \u956 \'ec\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\u8183 ?? \u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u969 \'f9\plain \f6\lang1033\fs24 \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 ? \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u8183 ?\plain \f6\lang1033\fs24 \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 ? \u949 \'e5\u7988 ?\u951 \'e7 \u948 \'e4\u8057 ?\u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1 \u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u956 \'ec\u8052 ? \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u8059 ?\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\u8183 ?\u963 \'f3\u8058 ?\u957 \'ed \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\plain \f6\lang1033\fs24 \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 ? \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u966 \'f6\u965 \'f5\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb. \plain \f1\fs24 - (f. 295r) an Stelle einer \u220 \'dcberschrift sieben Zw\u246 \'f6lfsilber: \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u919 \'c7 \u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8052 ? \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed \u967 \'f7\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f3\lang1024\fs24 , \plain \f1\fs24 ed. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Pichard\plain \f1\fs24 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Lit\plain \f1\fs24 ), S. XXVI; ed. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 A. Lukyn Williams\plain \f1\fs24 , Adversos Judaeos, Cambridge 1935, S. 181 (Anm. 4).}

