\pard\fi0\li0\tx570\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 (ff. 344r-353r) \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Basilius Caesariensis\plain \f1\fs24 , De legendis gentilium libris (Ms. \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f5\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u914 \'c2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2 \plain \f5\lang1033\fs24 [!] \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u8051 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\fs24 ), PG 31, 564-589; ed. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 F. Boulenger\plain \f1\fs24 , Saint Basile. Aux jeunes gens sur la mani\u232 \'e8re de tirer profit des lettres hell\u233 \'e9niques, Paris 31965; ed. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 N. G. Wils\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 on\plain \f1\fs24 , Saint Basil on the Value of Greek Literature, London 1975; ed. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 M. Naldini\plain \f1\fs24 , Basilio di Cesarea, Discorso ai giovani. Oratio ad adolescentes con la versione latina di Leonardo Bruni (Biblioteca Patristica 3), Florenz 1984, S. 80-134; CPG 2867; CPG Suppl. 2867.}

