\pard\fi0\li0\tx570\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 Vorsatz (ff. IIIr-Vv) mit Exzerpten aus <\plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Nicetas Heracleensis\plain \f1\fs24 >, Kommentar zu Gregorius Nazianzenus, Reden; vgl. CPG 3027. Text und Kommentar gelegentlich durch \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\fs24 /\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\fs24 voneinander abgesetzt. Text des Gregorius Nazianzenus in Lemmaform. - (ff. IIIr-IVv) aus dem Kommentar zu or. 44: \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?]\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u960 \'f0\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ? \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed \u7985 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u8050 ?\u961 \'f1 \u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u8049 ?\u963 \'f3\u963 \'f3\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2 \u966 \'f6\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u8001 ? \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u966 \'f6\u8054 ?\u962 \'f2 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb. - \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u959 \'ef\u8021 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed \u946 \'e2\u8055 \u8183 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u952 \'e8\u969 \'f9\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\plain \f6\lang1033\fs24 \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 ? \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb., \plain \f1\fs24 ed. lat. PG 127, 1431 D 8 ... \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 vento ad puppim commode et congruenter flante in mari feruntur. Ac delphinus \plain \f1\fs24 - 1434 D 8 \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 ad novam illam vitam discedamus\plain \f1\fs24 (vgl. f. 278r-v). - (ff. IVv-Vv) aus dem Kommentar zu or. 42 (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u915 \'c3\u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2 \u961 \'f1\u957 \'ed\u8189 ? \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\fs24 ), ed. lat. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 I. Billius\plain \f1\fs24 , S. Patris nostri Gregorii Nazianzeni Theologi opera, II, K\u246 \'f6ln 31690, S. 918-933 (mir nicht zug\u228 \'e4nglich; hier nach CPG 3027 zitiert); (f. Vr, 6. Z. v. o.) Beginn des Kommentars: \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u8182 ?\u962 \'f2 \u966 \'f6\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u8054 ?\u957 \'ed \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u8055 ?\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9 \u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8150 ? \u8017 ?\u956 \'ec\u8150 ?\u957 \'ed \u964 \'f4\u8048 ? \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8127 ? \u7952 ?\u956 \'ec\u8050 ? \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 des. mut. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\fs24 . Davor (ff. IVv-Vr) Argumentum (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u923 \'cb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\u946 \'e2\u8189 ?\u903 ?\u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\fs24 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 inc.\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u927 \'cf\u7985 ? \u7953 ?\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u8053 ?\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed \plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u8055 ?\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 des. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u8000 ?\u961 \'f1\u952 \'e8\u8182 ?\u962 \'f2 \u8183 ?\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\plain \f6\lang1033\fs24 \plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7940 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9 \u948 \'e4\u8050 ? \u959 \'ef\u8021 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\fs24 ed. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Sajdak\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 172-173; (f. Vv) die zwei ersten und die vier letzten Textzeilen mit brauner Tinte getilgt. 
