\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Hinterer Vorsatz (f. 278r-v) <\plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Nicetas Heracleensis\plain \f1\fs24 >, Exzerpt aus dem Kommentar zu Gregorius Nazianzenus, or. 44: \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u8166 ?\u957 \'ed \u948 \'e4\u8050 ? \u963 \'f3\u8058 ? \u8036 ?\u966 \'f6\u952 \'e8\u951 \'e7 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2 \u956 \'ec[\u8052 ? \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1]\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u8059 ?\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed \u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u966 \'f6\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed - \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u963 \'f3(\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8134 ?)\u961 \'f1(\u959 \'ef)\u962 \'f2 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed(\u952 \'e8\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u960 \'f0)\u8055 ?(\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2), \plain \f1\fs24 ed. lat. PG 127, 1428 B 13 \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Acnunc novus appare, non secundum hanc scripturam \plain \f1\fs24 - 1430 B 4 \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 ante salvatoris incarnationem\plain \f1\fs24 (vgl. oben, ff. IIIr-IVv). }

