\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 (ff. 1r-3r) \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Antonius Calosynas\plain \f1\fs24 , Vita des Laonicus Chalcocondyles (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u8118 ?\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7984 ?\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u966 \'f6\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u959 \'ef\u8055 ?\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed \u946 \'e2\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u935 \'d7\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u8059 ?\u955 \'eb(\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5) \plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 [\plain \f1\fs24 !\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hopf \plain \f1\fs24 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Lit\plain \f1\fs24 ), S. 243-245 nach dieser Hs. - (f. 1r) am Rand zus\u228 \'e4tzlicher (falscher) Titel von Andreas Darmarios (vgl. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 S\plain \f1\fs24 ).}

