\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 (ff. 53r-94v) \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Plutarchus\plain \f1\fs24 , Non posse suaviter vivi secundum Epicurum (Ms. \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u8158 ?\u927 \'cf\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9 \u959 \'ef\u8016 ?\u948 \'e4\u8050 ? \u950 \'e6\u8134 ?\u957 \'ed \u7952 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed \u7969 ?\u948 \'e4\u8051 ?\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\plain \f5\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ? \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u960 \'f0\u8055 ?\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f5\lang1033\fs24 ), \plain \f1\fs24 ed. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Pohlenz \plain \f1\fs24 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Lit\plain \f1\fs24 ), S. 124-172; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 des. imperfecte \plain \f1\fs24 S. 164, 19 \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u966 \'f6\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed \u7952 ?\u947 \'e3\u8060 ? \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\plain \f5\lang1033\fs24 .}

