\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 (ff. 1r-196v) \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Aristoteles\plain \f1\fs24 , Ars rhetorica (Ms. urspr\u252 \'fcnglich ohne Titel, \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u967 \'f7\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2 \u8165 ?\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ? \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8182 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed  \plain \f1\fs24 von Petrus Victorius sp\u228 \'e4ter hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt). - (ff. 1r-69r) Buch 1; mit erl\u228 \'e4uternden Figuren ff. 11v, 12r. - (ff. 70r-142r) 2. - (ff. 142v-196v) 3.}

