\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 2. (ff. 168r-235v) <\plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Theodoretus Cyrensis\plain \f1\fs24 >, Interpretatio in prophetas minores (Ms. ohne Gesamttitel), PG 81, 1552-1988; CPG 6208; BHG 1591; BHG Nov. Auct. 1591. - Jeweils vor Beginn eines neuen Buches Titel: \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u7952 ?\u958 \'ee\u8053 ?\u947 \'e3\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb. \plain \f1\fs24 Kapiteleinteilung h\u228 \'e4ufig abweichend von der Ausgabe. - (ff. 168r-174r) In Sophoniam (Ms. \plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u987 ?\u8189 ?\plain \f1\fs24 ), PG 1837-1860. - (ff. 174v-178r) In Aggaeum (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u950 \'e6\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\fs24 ), PG 1860-1873. - (ff. 178v-203v) In Zachariam (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u951 \'e7\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\fs24 ), PG 1873-1960. - (ff. 203v-210v) In Malachiam (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\fs24 ), PG 1960-1988. - (ff. 211r-219v) In Ioel (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\fs24 ), PG 1634-1664. - (ff. 219v-232v) In Amos (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?\plain \f1\fs24 ), PG 1664-1708. - (ff. 233r-235v) In Abdiam (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8189 ?)\plain \f1\fs24 PG 1709-1717.}

